BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (low-cost SMTP relays. Separate arithmetic from eligibility and delivery claims. Three hundred mailboxes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (sending 25 messages on twenty business days produce 150,000 monthly messages; at fifteen daily) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (messages they produce 90,000. Neither volume establishes primary-inbox placement. Developer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (subscriptions are for permitted development uses, and partner benefits have their own terms; verify current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (production and commercial sending rights before assigning any mailbox to outreach. Cloudflare Email) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Routing forwards incoming mail and is not an outbound SMTP service. Use a sending provider that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (expressly permits the intended activity, with authenticated domains and truthful sender identities. Avoid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (claiming $6-$12 retail seat savings until the eligible mailbox cost is documented. Two or three domains per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (tenant can simplify administration but do not authorize quota multiplication or restriction evasion. If eligible) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (subsidies cannot support production, budget paid infrastructure and reduce volume. Never rotate identities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (to defeat recipient blocking, provider enforcement, or unsubscribe requests. The commercial objective is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (qualified corporate conversations, not a manufactured count of nominally free accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Replace the proposed promise of 100% SMTP catch-all verification with layered address checks and honest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (uncertainty. Syntax and domain checks identify obvious errors; approved verification services can flag risk,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (but catch-all domains do not prove a particular person has a deliverable mailbox. Quarantine ambiguous) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (addresses or confirm them through an existing business relationship. Send plain-text messages without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (open pixels or tracking redirects, identify the business accurately, include a valid postal address and working) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (opt-out, and synchronize suppression across every domain. Under 15 U.S.C. ?7704, commercial email) Tj ET
